{"about_the_game":"<strong>Do you want to relax by the water in beautiful nature? </strong>European Fishing allow you to go on a virtual fishing tour. Select appropriate equipment and jump on a motorboat to go to one of the five huge lakes in search of the perfect fishery. Remember that each fish has a favorite time and place of feeding, and proper selection of lures also increase your chances of successful catch.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>14 species of fish with different seasons of feeding, behavior and favorite bait \t<br></li><li>Five large lakes in five European countries \t<br></li><li>Lots of fishing tackle equipment to choose from: fishing rods, floats, hooks, bait and lures, and even motorboats \t<br></li><li>Relaxing free play mode or challenge, where you check your skills \t<br></li><li>Open 3D environment</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/310640/extras/b5df42e8f543209cc817e6e7377e9009.avif?t=1528294978\" width=500 height=500 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/310640?t=1528294978","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/310640?t=1528294978","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/310640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1528294978","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/310640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1528294978","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong>Do you want to relax by the water in beautiful nature? </strong>European Fishing allow you to go on a virtual fishing tour. Select appropriate equipment and jump on a motorboat to go to one of the five huge lakes in search of the perfect fishery. Remember that each fish has 